https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITgB8vcuIlE  (Capo 3)

Lyle plays uncapo'd in (F) but here it is in (D) to avoid the (Bb).  There is another version in (G).

TIP:  Untransposed it's middle (g), open 3rd string, to begin singing on the first (G) at "you".  Rise up and then descend to the first (D).

TIP:  This is quite a slow song; play it as such.  


